  "description": "<p data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"1119\"><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">Maak </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">Mario </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">Kart </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">nog </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">leuker </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">met </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">dit </span><strong data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"943\"><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">Hori </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">Mario </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">Kart </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">Racing </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">Wheel</span></strong><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">. </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">Met </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">een </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">stuurcontroller </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">voelt </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">racen </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">een </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">stuk </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">realistischer </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">en </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">krijg </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">je </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">het </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">gevoel </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">dat </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">je </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">zelf </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">achter </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">het </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">stuur </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">zit </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">terwijl </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">je </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">door </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">de </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">kleurrijke </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">banen </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">van </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">Mario </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">Kart </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">scheurt.</span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1368\"><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">Het </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">stuur </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">is </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">speciaal </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">ontworpen </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">voor </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">Nintendo </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">consoles </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">en </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">ligt </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">prettig </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">in </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">de </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">hand. </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">Hierdoor </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">is </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">het </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">ideaal </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">voor </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">gezellige </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">multiplayer </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">races </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">met </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">vrienden </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">of </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">familie. </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">Vooral </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">bij </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">Mario </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">Kart </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">zorgt </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">een </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">racing </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">wheel </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">voor </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">extra </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">plezier </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">tijdens </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">het </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">spelen.</span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1551\"><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">Dit </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">exemplaar </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">is </span><strong data-start=\"1387\" data-end=\"1398\"><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">B-</span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">grade</span></strong><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">, </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">wat </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">betekent </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">dat </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">het </span><strong data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1438\"><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">goed </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">gebruikt</span></strong> <span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">is </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">maar </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">nog </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">netjes </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">functioneert. </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">Het </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">stuur </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">wordt </span><strong data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1509\"><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">compleet </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">geleverd</span></strong><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">, </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">zodat </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">je </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">direct </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">kunt </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">beginnen </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">met </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">racen.</span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1733\"><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">Bij </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">aankoop </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">ontvang </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">je </span><strong data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1596\"><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">1 </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">maand </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">garantie</span></strong><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">. </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">Door </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">te </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">kiezen </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">voor </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">een </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">tweedehands </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">gaming </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">accessoire </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">maak </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">je </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">bovendien </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">een </span><strong data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1692\"><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">duurzame </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">keuze</span></strong> <span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">en </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">geef </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">je </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">elektronica </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">een </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">tweede </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">leven.</span></p>",
